{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Maghadeva: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja9'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 9 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Apaṇṇakavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Sure Bet </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>9. Maghadevajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Maghadeva: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Uttamaṅgaruhā mayhaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Growing on top of my head, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>ime jātā vayoharā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>these thieves of life have sprouted. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Pātubhūtā devadūtā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Messengers of the gods have appeared—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>pabbajjāsamayo mamā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>it is time for me to go forth. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Maghadevajātakaṁ navamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
